    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
    # RACCOURCIS
    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

    def _kb_play_pause(self):
        if not hasattr(self, "preview_label") or not self.preview_label:
            return
        if self.audio_playing:
            self._pause_preview_audio()
        else:
            self._play_preview_audio()

    def _kb_escape(self):
        if hasattr(self, "preview_label") and self.preview_label:
            self.show_home()


    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
    # FFMPEG CHECK
    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

    def _check_ffmpeg(self):
        missing = [t for t in ("ffmpeg", "ffplay") if not shutil.which(t)]
        if not missing:
            return
        tools = " et ".join(missing)
        banner = ctk.CTkFrame(self, fg_color="#431407", corner_radius=0, height=40)
        banner.pack(fill="x", side="bottom")
        banner.pack_propagate(False)
        ctk.CTkLabel(banner, text=f"âš   {tools} introuvable â€” export et preview audio indisponibles.",
                     text_color=WARN, font=FONT_SM).pack(side="left", padx=16, pady=10)
        ctk.CTkLabel(banner, text="â†’ Installe FFmpeg et ajoute-le au PATH",
                     text_color="#fdba74", font=FONT_MU).pack(side="left")
        _btn(banner, "âœ•", banner.destroy, small=True, width=32, height=24,
             fg_color="transparent", hover_color="#7c2d12").pack(side="right", padx=12)

    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
    # DRAG & DROP
    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

    def _on_drop(self, event):
        raw = event.data.strip()
        paths = re.findall(r"\{([^}]+)\}", raw) if raw.startswith("{") else raw.split()

        # Routage Turbo : si la vue Turbo est active, dÃ©lÃ©guer
        if self._turbo_view_active:
            self._turbo_add_paths(paths)
            return

        audio_found = image_found = ""
        for p in paths:
            ext = Path(p).suffix.lower()
            if ext in AUDIO_EXTS and not audio_found:
                audio_found = p
            elif ext in IMAGE_EXTS and not image_found:
                image_found = p
        if not audio_found and not image_found:
            self._set_status("Format non reconnu", DANGER)
            return
        if audio_found:
            self.audio_path = audio_found
            self._parse_audio_filename(audio_found)
        if image_found:
            self.image_path = image_found
        if self.audio_path and self.image_path:
            self.show_editor()
        elif self.audio_path:
            self.show_step_image()

    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
    # UI BUILD
    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

    def _build_ui(self):
        # â”€â”€ Header â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        hdr = ctk.CTkFrame(self, height=52, fg_color=SURF, corner_radius=0)
        hdr.pack(fill="x", side="top")
        hdr.pack_propagate(False)

        # SÃ©parateur header â€” dÃ©gradÃ© indigo (ACCENT â†’ BORDER â†’ ACCENT)
        self._hdr_sep = tk.Canvas(self, height=2, bg=SURF, bd=0, highlightthickness=0)
        self._hdr_sep.pack(fill="x", side="top")
        self._hdr_sep.bind("<Configure>", lambda e: self._draw_header_separator())

        # Logo carrÃ©
        logo_sq = ctk.CTkFrame(hdr, width=28, height=28, corner_radius=6,
                               fg_color=ACCENT)
        logo_sq.pack(side="left", padx=(16, 8), pady=12)
        logo_sq.pack_propagate(False)
        ctk.CTkLabel(logo_sq, text="â–¶", font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 11, "bold"),
                     text_color="#ffffff").place(relx=0.5, rely=0.5, anchor="center")

        ctk.CTkLabel(hdr, text="TAC", font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 22, "bold"),
                     text_color=ACCLT).pack(side="left")
        ctk.CTkLabel(hdr, text=" Studio", font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 22, "bold"),
                     text_color=TEXT).pack(side="left")

        # Bouton rÃ©glages âš™
        gear = ctk.CTkButton(hdr, text="âš™", width=36, height=36,
                             fg_color="transparent", hover_color=SURF2,
                             text_color=TEXT2, font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 16),
                             corner_radius=8, border_color=BORDER2, border_width=0,
                             command=self._open_settings_window)
        gear.pack(side="right", padx=(0, 12), pady=8)
        _Tooltip(gear, "RÃ©glages")

        # Status
        self._status_dot = ctk.CTkLabel(hdr, text="â—", text_color=MUTED,
                                        font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 8))
        self._status_dot.pack(side="right", padx=(0, 4))
        self._status_lbl = ctk.CTkLabel(hdr, textvariable=self.status_var,
                                        text_color=MUTED, font=FONT_MU)
        self._status_lbl.pack(side="right", padx=(0, 6))

        # â”€â”€ Zone principale â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        self.main = ctk.CTkFrame(self, fg_color=BG, corner_radius=0)
        self.main.pack(fill="both", expand=True)

        # â”€â”€ Barre raccourcis en bas â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        ctk.CTkFrame(self, height=1, fg_color=BORDER, corner_radius=0).pack(
            fill="x", side="bottom")
        shortcuts_bar = ctk.CTkFrame(self, height=22, fg_color=SURF, corner_radius=0)
        shortcuts_bar.pack(fill="x", side="bottom")
        shortcuts_bar.pack_propagate(False)
        _sc_hints = ["Espace Â· Preview", "R Â· Recharger", "Ã‰chap Â· Retour"]
        for i, hint in enumerate(_sc_hints):
            ctk.CTkLabel(shortcuts_bar, text=hint, text_color=MUTED,
                         font=FONT_MU).pack(side="left", padx=18 if i == 0 else 22,
                                            pady=3)

    # â”€â”€ SÃ©parateur header dÃ©gradÃ© â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€

    def _draw_header_separator(self):
        """Dessine un dÃ©gradÃ© horizontal ACCENT â†’ BORDER â†’ ACCENT sur le canvas
        sous le header. RappelÃ© sur <Configure> pour suivre le resize."""
        c = getattr(self, "_hdr_sep", None)
        if c is None:
            return
        try:
            if not c.winfo_exists():
                return
            w = c.winfo_width()
            h = c.winfo_height()
        except Exception:
            return
        if w < 2:
            return
        c.delete("all")

        def _hx(hx):
            hx = hx.lstrip("#")
            return (int(hx[0:2], 16), int(hx[2:4], 16), int(hx[4:6], 16))

        a = _hx(ACCENT)   # extrÃ©mitÃ©s
        b = _hx(BORDER)   # centre
        last = max(1, w - 1)
        for x in range(w):
            t = x / last
            if t < 0.5:
                tt = t / 0.5            # ACCENT â†’ BORDER
                r = int(a[0] + (b[0] - a[0]) * tt)
                g = int(a[1] + (b[1] - a[1]) * tt)
                bl = int(a[2] + (b[2] - a[2]) * tt)
            else:
                tt = (t - 0.5) / 0.5    # BORDER â†’ ACCENT
                r = int(b[0] + (a[0] - b[0]) * tt)
                g = int(b[1] + (a[1] - b[1]) * tt)
                bl = int(b[2] + (a[2] - b[2]) * tt)
            c.create_line(x, 0, x, h, fill=f"#{r:02x}{g:02x}{bl:02x}")

    def _clear_main(self):
        self._turbo_view_active = False
        # Annuler l'animation de l'accueil (fix fuite mÃ©moire Update 8)
        if hasattr(self, "_home_anim_job") and self._home_anim_job:
            try:
                self.after_cancel(self._home_anim_job)
            except Exception:
                pass
            self._home_anim_job = None
        # Stopper l'animation du dot de statut (anti-fuite after())
        if getattr(self, "_status_dot_job", None):
            try:
                self.after_cancel(self._status_dot_job)
            except Exception:
                pass
            self._status_dot_job = None
        self._status_dot_active = False
        # Fermer une Ã©ventuelle carte de succÃ¨s export
        self._dismiss_export_success_card()
        self._stop_audio()
        self.preview_running = False
        self._preview_glow = None
        self._waveform_canvas = None
        # Supprimer les traces StringVar des CTkEntry avant destruction.
        # Sinon le _textvariable_callback interne de CTkEntry se dÃ©clenche
        # sur un widget dÃ©truit Ã  chaque .set() ultÃ©rieur â†’ TclError.
        for _var in ("artist_text", "title_text", "subtitle_text",
                     "preview_start", "project_name_var"):
            _sv = getattr(self, _var, None)
            if _sv is None:
                continue
            for _mode, _cbname in list(_sv.trace_info()):
                try:
                    _sv.trace_remove(_mode, _cbname)
                except Exception:
                    pass
        for child in self.main.winfo_children():
            child.destroy()

    def _set_status(self, text, color=MUTED):
        self.status_var.set(text)
        self._status_color = color
        if hasattr(self, "_status_dot"):
            # Ne pas Ã©craser la couleur du dot s'il est en cours d'animation
            if not getattr(self, "_status_dot_active", False):
                self._status_dot.configure(text_color=color)
            self._status_lbl.configure(text_color=color)

    # â”€â”€ Dot de statut animÃ© â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€

    def _animate_status_dot(self, active: bool):
        """Anime le point de statut dans le header.

        active=True  â†’ alterne ACCENT / MUTED toutes les 600 ms.
        active=False â†’ fige sur la derniÃ¨re couleur passÃ©e Ã  _set_status.
        """
        # Annuler toute boucle en cours
        if getattr(self, "_status_dot_job", None):
            try:
                self.after_cancel(self._status_dot_job)
            except Exception:
                pass
            self._status_dot_job = None

        self._status_dot_active = bool(active)

        if not active:
            if hasattr(self, "_status_dot"):
                try:
                    self._status_dot.configure(
                        text_color=getattr(self, "_status_color", MUTED))
                except Exception:
                    pass
            return

        self._status_dot_phase = False

        def _pulse():
            if not getattr(self, "_status_dot_active", False):
                return
            if not hasattr(self, "_status_dot"):
                return
            self._status_dot_phase = not getattr(self, "_status_dot_phase", False)
            col = ACCENT if self._status_dot_phase else MUTED
            try:
                self._status_dot.configure(text_color=col)
            except Exception:
                return
            try:
                self._status_dot_job = self.after(600, _pulse)
            except Exception:
                self._status_dot_job = None

        _pulse()

    # â”€â”€ Halo indigo autour de la preview â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€

    def _set_preview_glow(self, running: bool):
        """Allume (running=True â†’ ACCGLOW) ou attÃ©nue le halo indigo qui
        entoure la preview vidÃ©o."""
        glow = getattr(self, "_preview_glow", None)
        if glow is None:
            return
        try:
            glow.configure(fg_color=ACCGLOW if running else PREVIEW_GLOW_IDLE)
        except Exception:
            pass

    # â”€â”€ Carte de succÃ¨s export â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€

    def _show_export_success_card(self, output_dir: str, file_name: str):
        """Overlay centrÃ© confirmant un export rÃ©ussi.
        Auto-fermeture aprÃ¨s 8 s ; bouton accent pour ouvrir le dossier."""
        self._dismiss_export_success_card()
        if not hasattr(self, "main") or self.main is None:
            return

        ov = ctk.CTkFrame(self.main, fg_color=SURF2, corner_radius=16,
                          border_color=BORDER2, border_width=1)
        ov.place(relx=0.5, rely=0.5, anchor="center")
        self._export_success_card = ov

        inner = ctk.CTkFrame(ov, fg_color="transparent")
        inner.pack(padx=44, pady=(30, 26))

        ctk.CTkLabel(inner, text="âœ“", text_color=SUCCESS,
                     font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 28, "bold")).pack()
        ctk.CTkLabel(inner, text=f"{file_name}.mp4", text_color=TEXT,
                     font=ctk.CTkFont("Segoe UI", 14, "bold")).pack(pady=(10, 2))
        ctk.CTkLabel(inner, text=str(output_dir), text_color=MUTED,
                     font=FONT_MU, wraplength=320, justify="center").pack(pady=(0, 20))

        btns = ctk.CTkFrame(inner, fg_color="transparent")
        btns.pack()
        _btn(btns, "ðŸ“‚  Ouvrir le dossier",
             lambda d=str(output_dir): open_file(d),
             accent=True, height=40, width=200).pack(side="left", padx=(0, 8))
        _btn(btns, "Fermer", self._dismiss_export_success_card,
             ghost=True, height=40, width=100).pack(side="left")

        # Auto-fermeture aprÃ¨s 8 s
        try:
            self._export_success_job = self.after(8000, self._dismiss_export_success_card)
        except Exception:
            self._export_success_job = None

    def _dismiss_export_success_card(self):
        if getattr(self, "_export_success_job", None):
            try:
                self.after_cancel(self._export_success_job)
            except Exception:
                pass
            self._export_success_job = None
        card = getattr(self, "_export_success_card", None)
        if card is not None:
            try:
                card.destroy()
            except Exception:
                pass
            self._export_success_card = None

    def _on_close(self):
        try:
            self._persist_now()
            self._stop_audio()
        finally:
            self.destroy()

    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
    # PAGES â€” voir app/ui/pages.py (PagesMixin)
    # â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

    # â”€â”€ Ã‰diteur â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€

    def show_editor(self):
        self._clear_main()
        self._set_status("Preview", SUCCESS)

        if self.audio_path:
            self._load_waveform(self.audio_path)

        # Suspendre le rendu tkinter pendant la construction de l'UI
        self.main.update_idletasks()

        left = ctk.CTkFrame(self.main, fg_color=BG)
        left.pack(side="left", fill="both", expand=True, padx=(14, 6), pady=12)
        right_outer = ctk.CTkFrame(self.main, fg_color=BG, width=372)
        right_outer.pack(side="right", fill="y", padx=(0, 14), pady=12)
        right_outer.pack_propagate(False)

        # â”€â”€ Preview â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        # Halo indigo qui entoure la preview (s'allume quand la preview tourne)
        self._preview_glow = ctk.CTkFrame(left, fg_color=PREVIEW_GLOW_IDLE,
                                          corner_radius=16)
        self._preview_glow.pack(fill="both", expand=True)

        preview_wrap = ctk.CTkFrame(self._preview_glow, fg_color="#000000",
                                    corner_radius=14,
                                    border_color=BORDER2, border_width=1)
        preview_wrap.pack(fill="both", expand=True, padx=2, pady=2)
        self.preview_wrap = preview_wrap

        # Tag "PREVIEW LIVE"
        self._pv_tag = tk.Label(preview_wrap, text="PREVIEW LIVE", bg="#000000",
                                fg=MUTED, font=("Consolas", 8))
        self._pv_tag.place(x=8, y=6)

        self.preview_label = tk.Label(preview_wrap, bg="#000000", bd=0, highlightthickness=0)
        self.preview_label.pack(fill="both", expand=True)

        # â”€â”€ Waveform â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        wf_frame = ctk.CTkFrame(left, fg_color=SURF, corner_radius=10,
                                 border_color=BORDER, border_width=1, height=60)
        wf_frame.pack(fill="x", pady=(10, 0))
        wf_frame.pack_propagate(False)
        self._waveform_canvas = tk.Canvas(wf_frame, bg="#08080f", bd=0,
                                          highlightthickness=0, height=56)
        self._waveform_canvas.pack(fill="both", expand=True, padx=2, pady=2)
        self._waveform_canvas.bind("<Button-1>", self._on_waveform_click)
        self._waveform_canvas.bind("<Configure>", lambda e: self._draw_waveform())
        _Tooltip(self._waveform_canvas, "Clic pour naviguer Â· Zone indigo = durÃ©e preview")

        # â”€â”€ ContrÃ´les â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€
        ctrl = ctk.CTkFrame(left, fg_color="transparent")
        ctrl.pack(fill="x", pady=(8, 0))
        _btn(ctrl, "â–¶ Preview", self._play_preview_audio,
             accent=True, width=100, height=32, small=True).pack(side="left", padx=(0, 6))
        _btn(ctrl, "â¸", self._pause_preview_audio,
             ghost=True, width=38, height=32, small=True).pack(side="left", padx=(0, 4))
        _btn(ctrl, "âŸ² Reset", self._prepare_preview,
             ghost=True, height=32, small=True).pack(side="left", padx=(0, 4))
